[Info]
Name	The Last Gate
Description	Six portals across the whole width of the deep. The waves are slow and heavy, like a door closing. Skirmish. A hero company holds a walled keep in the wilds; storm them for their gold, or leave them be and fight whatever they send out.
Music	Searching_yd.ogg
FightMusic	TheDarkAmulet_MP.ogg
[/Info]

